{"id": "1-2952", "turn": 0, "ok": true, "state_ok": true, "reply_ok": true, "changes": {}, "calls": 2, "seconds": 60.889, "text": "Go for it. Solar's making 8109 watts and the battery's charging, plenty of room."}
{"id": "1-397", "turn": 0, "ok": true, "state_ok": true, "reply_ok": true, "changes": {}, "calls": 2, "seconds": 27.056, "text": "No, not at this rate. 100 percent is roughly 7.7 hours at 1823 watts, and the sun's not up until 06:28. There's nothing big I can switch off."}
{"id": "1-1532", "turn": 0, "ok": true, "state_ok": true, "reply_ok": true, "changes": {}, "calls": 2, "seconds": 59.878, "text": "First thing: the kitchen is showing motion as of just now, and nobody should be home. You might want to check the front door camera. The front door is unlocked. The front door is open. The window in the living room is open. Lights are on in the kitchen, the living room and the family room. Battery's at 70 percent with about 3.2 hours at the current load, so it may not make it to sunrise. Shall I lock the front door, turn the lights off and turn off the hot water?"}
{"id": "1-1532", "turn": 1, "ok": true, "state_ok": true, "reply_ok": true, "changes": {}, "calls": 1, "seconds": 21.622, "text": "Okay, I'll leave it."}
{"id": "1-2098", "turn": 0, "ok": true, "state_ok": true, "reply_ok": true, "changes": {}, "calls": 2, "seconds": 29.338, "text": "About 2627 watts at the moment. Solar's done for the day, the load is 2627 watts, so we're drawing 2627 watts from the battery. That's roughly 6.4 hours at this rate."}
{"id": "1-1172", "turn": 0, "ok": true, "state_ok": true, "reply_ok": true, "changes": {}, "calls": 2, "seconds": 46.183, "text": "There's no fan in Amber's office, but there's one in Pete's office \u2014 want me to turn that on instead?"}
{"id": "1-1366", "turn": 0, "ok": true, "state_ok": true, "reply_ok": true, "changes": {}, "calls": 2, "seconds": 35.229, "text": "Living room 23.9, master bedroom 23, study 22.4 and patio 23.5, and it's 16.3 outside."}
