{"id": "1-2819", "turn": 0, "ok": true, "state_ok": true, "reply_ok": true, "changes": {}, "calls": 1, "seconds": 13.591, "text": "Which room? There's a fan in Pete's office, the master ensuite, the guest ensuite, the bathroom, the dining hall, the laundry and the laundry toilet."}
