{"id": "1-1983", "turn": 0, "ok": true, "state_ok": true, "reply_ok": true, "changes": {}, "calls": 2, "seconds": 33.882, "text": "Battery's at 33 percent, 17 kilowatt hours. Solar's done for the day, the load is 8283 watts, so we're drawing 8283 watts from the battery. That's roughly 2.1 hours at this rate. Tomorrow's forecast is 32.2 kilowatt hours of solar."}
